  "id": "banana-coconut-loaf",
  "name": "Banana Coconut Loaf",
  "subtitle": "A tender loaf with coconut, walnuts, and cherries",
  "description": "Mashed bananas, coconut, walnuts, and cherries add texture and flavor to this simple fruit loaf.",
